BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:POV: You Found a Good Book
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T190000
UID:69d67ed9f29b90618efdbc89@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Not your average book club.\nThink less assigned reading\, mor
 e good vibes\, real talk\, and stories that actually hit. No pressure\, no
  quizzes—just snacks\, chill convos\, and books you might actually want 
 to finish.\nCome hang out\, meet people your age\, and help pick what we r
 ead next. You might even find a book you don’t hate.\nDrop in. Bring a f
