 nd how to use the Prusa software.\nRegistration will start 2 weeks before 
 this class. Computers will be provided.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
